title: "Rul (.rl): A 128-Bit Schedule- and Proof-Carrying Binary SSA-DAG Programming Language and Execution Engine for Autonomous AI Agents"
message: "If you use Rul (.rl), its binary specification, O(N) linear verifier, or execution engine in your research or software, please cite it using the metadata below."
